descriere:
Nivel de vechime: Nivel mediu de experiență
Tip de angajare: Full-time
Sectoare de activitate: Industria prelucrătoare
PREH ROMANIA - famous supplier of car components, which produces multifunctional switches for steering wheel and central command and control elements for the automotive industry (BMW, Audi, Daimler, Porsche, etc.), is looking for the production site in the Brașov Industrial Park in Ghimbav, for a:
 Central Logistics Specialist Planning & Customer support 
 Requirements: 
Superior studies;
Previous experience within the Logistics department in planning and/or customer support (minimum 3 years);
Good SAP knowledge;
English knowledge at an advanced level;
German knowledge is a plus;
MS Office knowledge;
Good organizing, team work, communication and problem solving skills;
Good negotiation skills;
Open to business travelling if needed.
 Responsibilities: 
Reviewing, documentation and optimizing logistical setups and processes for all global manufacturing plants with focus on customer service and production planning;
Participating in SAP optimization projects for logistics;
Developing and implementing standards, concepts and tools as part of the Preh Group Central Logistics in close relationship with plant logistics;
Implementing, optimizing and constantly surveying of the developed measures, processes and structures worldwide;
Coordination and support of ongoing logistics projects and interfaces.
